# Every text file stays LF on every platform.
#
# The refresh job compares snapshots byte-for-byte to decide whether anything changed,
# and a CRLF checkout on Windows would make each of them look modified every hour — an
# empty commit per hour, which is exactly what the workflow is written to avoid.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary artefacts
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.webp binary
*.ico binary
